{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/29b4d003c5047b47d11ce6ecd6e67093.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature themes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story filled with hope!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing Knights of Messiah IF: Castle in an Alternate Dimension!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the colorful world of Knights of Messiah as the leader of your very own party of adventurers! When your wife Alicia and little sister Maya are kidnapped by the Prince of Windsor, Ritz, you and your friends decide to locate the &quot;Gemstones&quot; hidden away in the land's various dungeons that'll let you access his interdimensional castle!\u00a0Engage in battle through random encounters, defeat your enemies through classic JRPG turn-based combat, level up your party's swordsmanship, archery, and magic skills, and become a hero in this addicting RPG Maker experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo features a few hours of playable content and lets you explore one of the dungeons from the full game! If you like it, feel free to check out the full version!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/da17b3916f6a764b675a8784c0f7f467.avif?t=1760343576\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One year ago, the Kingdom of Mordouna and the various nations of the Empire were wrapped up in what was to become known as the Messiah Knights War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, Celis and Alicia have been happily married. However, Alicia and Celis's sister Maya are about to be kidnapped by Prince Ritz of the Kingdom of Windsor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celis, Magic General Lini, and the merchant Riku head out to save Alicia and Maya. However, the Kingdom of Windsor is in an alternate dimension, and to access it, Celis and his companions will have to locate the magic Gemstones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Alicia and Maya attempt to fight back against their captives and flee, they'll be promptly executed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to save them yet, Celis and his companions can only watch events unfold through a crystal ball\u2026 That probably makes this game sound depressing, but it's actually relatively optimistic! If you don't want to play something really dark, don't worry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the difficulty yourself, but the default difficulty is quite easy, so you can experience the story without any worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/dad977ea1dab89632ffed9150c3aef68.avif?t=1760343576\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/f88e017b118c2dd20d503d5e8ca5bb76.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/9276be9ac7706554fc8b4c2b5e6b8c77.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/dba0f264f93aa1477421d2f3df317637.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/4d80db75fe89a41df8d806d6fb70e54d.avif?t=1760343576\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/8b14a112f5cc6849063c8837858b3875.poster.avif?t=1760343576\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/8b14a112f5cc6849063c8837858b3875.webm?t=1760343576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/8b14a112f5cc6849063c8837858b3875.mp4?t=1760343576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning character graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random encounters with tons of different enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An array of different skills and spells for every situation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain EXP and level up, buy better equipment for your party members, and use unique items in battle to ensure victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging story in visual novel format</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to understand even for newcomers to the JRPG genre</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994360?t=1760343576","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994360?t=1760343576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/47b82a6a828ad471efb8d0c84066b36646470f06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760343576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/47b82a6a828ad471efb8d0c84066b36646470f06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760343576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"All characters in this game are 18 or older.\r\nContains cartoony violence and references to kidnapping/abduction. Do not play this game if you are uncomfortable with such content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/29b4d003c5047b47d11ce6ecd6e67093.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature themes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story filled with hope!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introducing Knights of Messiah IF: Castle in an Alternate Dimension!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the colorful world of Knights of Messiah as the leader of your very own party of adventurers! When your wife Alicia and little sister Maya are kidnapped by the Prince of Windsor, Ritz, you and your friends decide to locate the &quot;Gemstones&quot; hidden away in the land's various dungeons that'll let you access his interdimensional castle!\u00a0Engage in battle through random encounters, defeat your enemies through classic JRPG turn-based combat, level up your party's swordsmanship, archery, and magic skills, and become a hero in this addicting RPG Maker experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This demo features a few hours of playable content and lets you explore one of the dungeons from the full game! If you like it, feel free to check out the full version!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/da17b3916f6a764b675a8784c0f7f467.avif?t=1760343576\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One year ago, the Kingdom of Mordouna and the various nations of the Empire were wrapped up in what was to become known as the Messiah Knights War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since then, Celis and Alicia have been happily married. However, Alicia and Celis's sister Maya are about to be kidnapped by Prince Ritz of the Kingdom of Windsor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celis, Magic General Lini, and the merchant Riku head out to save Alicia and Maya. However, the Kingdom of Windsor is in an alternate dimension, and to access it, Celis and his companions will have to locate the magic Gemstones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Alicia and Maya attempt to fight back against their captives and flee, they'll be promptly executed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unable to save them yet, Celis and his companions can only watch events unfold through a crystal ball\u2026 That probably makes this game sound depressing, but it's actually relatively optimistic! If you don't want to play something really dark, don't worry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select the difficulty yourself, but the default difficulty is quite easy, so you can experience the story without any worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/dad977ea1dab89632ffed9150c3aef68.avif?t=1760343576\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/f88e017b118c2dd20d503d5e8ca5bb76.avif?t=1760343576\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994360/extras/9276be9ac7706554fc8b4c2b5e